<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Internalized Reasoning for Long-Context Visual Document Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>External SFT data composition</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
