</section>
</section>
<section id="S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5 </span>Experiments</h2>

<div id="S5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We organize experiments around our contributions: state-of-the-art performance via synthetic reasoning (§<a href="#S5.SS1" title="5.1 Main results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Internalized Reasoning for Long-Context Visual Document Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.1</span></a>), internalization of reasoning with minimal token overhead and causal evidence for the inference-time capability via control token ablations (§<a href="#S5.SS2" title="5.2 Internalization and control token analysis ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Internalized Reasoning for Long-Context Visual Document Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.2</span></a>), and the impact of trace design (§<a href="#S5.SS3" title="5.3 Trace iteration ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Internalized Reasoning for Long-Context Visual Document Understanding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.3</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<section id="S5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.1 </span>Main results</h3>

<figure id="S5.T3" class="ltx_table">
